{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0a7d63090279ac57cd4493643c215917db4a2cc29d1232db5557ffbfab7960b5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9dc8216295fef7e7109a967b9263be4fcc960c2c97f385bc6ca1e053e7ab17cd"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"The action exposes outputs runId, runUrl, runUrlHtml, and workflowId describing the triggered workflow run.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_48fc76b459966a6b51a16048da35f820d62c5fa90a0a2b2b580f9bc45fa3f609","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fbd8b8f19271cedc9247c835a8b3b54dceb8d7f491e0b7e2a5007f87eb3c8fee"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"By default workflows are triggered in the same repo; an optional `repo` input (owner/name) enables triggering in another repository.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_55e60e31c082f76692d9e1716ad43c506b219855fc5f1cc1cf1f5a48c655fdb5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6a6ce9ae3849f711be9009ffa501d7beebb3bf034696cad50e3a4b8410d15295"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"Workflows triggered by this action appear in the GitHub UI as \"manually triggered\", since the action simulates the manual workflow_dispatch trigger.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5bbd03c504971e64a0da710c8c58a9c6d8e8320a7659ad3a7d5b73d32a855510","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8c96728cf221af1f4948c12a62c62cd5ba6c27b5b413c4da13ab479870036f8f"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"The intended use case is chaining workflows, e.g. a CI build workflow triggering a CD deploy workflow, allowing separate CI/CD workflows that pass data between them.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_62efcea2197d2796fcf407626b6f50ab4c95abb4309c2db4d9e01d809d639b27","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c888c2d27ffbc5678d082ec9103653c5c158e1444355222aa4e918936f391acf"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"An optional `ref` input sets the Git reference (branch, tag, or commit SHA) for the triggered run; if omitted, the triggering workflow's context ref is used.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_773d0a99079f5de9e41aed1cc476e26f8554f2e13e70175d6d2a040195f6cb78","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_24ac131ef9ca8149bbab02b7134dd9659bd8ea60d7c5e31ba319435aae2f4916"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"The `wait-timeout-seconds` input caps waiting at a default of 900 seconds (15 minutes), applying only when wait-for-completion is enabled.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_77f1a4d8c9666b80d9e4d84fb2a3baf5204b83111a73acbd9289fd8974ad67ca","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13734364f8f3226882b7769236e18ff3de573ebc3198206b1f3ab406eb1ab090"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"The action triggers another GitHub Actions workflow using the workflow_dispatch event, and the target workflow must be configured for that event type.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ab9bbaa57f9fdc21277935e768b48616af8930bf3bad777aedb0f5f6ebaf8775","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_12d6c4e3f469d511953a0b1c01127f1dc0c62dbfa3073169ca0f9f5cca066edb"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"The required `workflow` input accepts the target workflow's name, filename, or ID, and all three forms are used when looking up the workflow.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b55009ba4a706844940229229c032d80b0989f470803fd1c81cefd419a991c84","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_774307709a3c2279421b14f98c141e12f49843f71f3709afe3e06ca1857b67fa"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"An optional `inputs` parameter passes inputs to the target workflow as a JSON-encoded string, for workflows that have inputs configured.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b58084cd291ef269914f25524263ce4321732e65c35c792fa5f8c82c090e3d85","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_372d91b5466484f04314edbd3139ffcd3513b463c3ec71bae96b416fe9ab54d7","slc_e1fe903a7ac8719b3b437901d0a61ccd49b8da27479849314374c297691f5e0a"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"Setting `wait-for-completion` to true makes the action poll the triggered run's status every 5 seconds until it finishes, with the interval configurable via `wait-interval-seconds`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e82c34f2e54f92acd6b43e9d545f4a28b3a67c9fd93d8a2f2a18b0d8d5b3a505","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_80f35d14ffa000a54ea785697624b5108e3ea7f6be76eed28c2a07a7b438ba74","slc_e5fcdd4075a8f963e8aaf00d9b445d5d778b96d56ce444cc89fc5809da0b5828"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"By default the standard GITHUB_TOKEN is used, so users no longer need to supply their own token; cross-repo dispatch requires a PAT with repo rights passed via a secret.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ea7812eac26aae256d286a7384eef75f0576b16ea50b6b05f4d3a5bc15dab073","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch@78e99d70d9ac snapshot 3eb4093669280522","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_25152e8755e88041d3efbf5362ed6182b60215f7f8abb426653e0acb0e9d19b5"],"source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"text":"With `sync-status` set to true, the action fails if the triggered workflow run fails or is cancelled; this requires wait-for-completion to be enabled.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
